>> i := 0.
Baʼii barreessi: ['Can we count to 10 using a whileTrue loop ?'], dhaabi.
{ Baʼii barreessi: i, dhaabi. } yemmuuhangafa: { i idaʼi: 1. <- (i ≤ 10). }.
Baʼii barreessi: ['Can we count back from 10 to 0 using a whileFalse loop ?'], dhaabi.
{ Baʼii barreessi: i, dhaabi. } yemmuuhangafa: { i hiri: 1. <- (i ≥ 0). }.
